  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Plan International PH: Uniting Against OSAEC, Safe Digital Space</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to protect 1000 children from online sexual exploitation in the Philippines. The three-year project is part of Plan International&apos;s Protection from Violence project called SUFASEC (Step up on the Fight against Sexual Exploitation of Children) supported through multiple donors.</narrative>
  </description>
